      - Interlaken, Berner Oberland
      - Interlaken, Oberland bernois
      - Interlaken, Bernese Oberland
      - "\u56E0\u7279\u62C9\u80AF\u5730\u533A\uFF0C\u4F2F\u6069\u9AD8\u5730"
