      - Genferseeregion
      - "R\xE9gion du L\xE9man"
      - "Cenevre G\xF6l\xFC B\xF6lgesi"
      - "\u65E5\u5185\u74E6\u6E56\u533A"
      - Wilayah Danau Jenewa
      - "\u65E5\u5167\u74E6\u6E56\u5340"
